---
title: "WonderVision save protocol"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Breaks NoRacedOverwrite
    lg1: Path to the NoRacedOverwrite bug
  }
  class lg0 breaks
  class lg1 bugPath
  s0: Ready for edits or saving
  s1: Checking expected disk content
  s2: Writing the captured snapshot to a temporary file
  s3: Final disk check passed
  s4: Outside writer changed disk after final check
  s5: Newer outside write was replaced
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you save a captured snapshot
  s1 --> s2: the first disk check finishes
  s2 --> s3: the final disk check finishes
  s3 --> s4: another process writes the file
  s4 --> s5: the snapshot replaces the file
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 bugPath
  class s5 breaks
  class s5 bugPath
